ECharts for Power BI may use third-party components including ECharts, jQuery, echarts-gl, echarts-liquidfill, and echarts-stat.

Copyright in these components remains with their respective copyright holders, and each component is governed by its own open-source license or terms. This License does not replace, modify, or restrict rights granted under those third-party licenses.

